WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
Hey guys.
We've got a huge problem in the church today.&nbsp;

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:09.720
A lot of people are listening to preachers who&nbsp;
preach to itching ears, who allow it to happen.&nbsp;

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:13.500
Who listen to motivational messages&nbsp;
that's just puffing up the self life.&nbsp;

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.420
But Jesus calls us to deny ourselves.
To pick up our cross and follow Jesus.&nbsp;

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:22.860
I want to read a quote to you&nbsp;
from my book Bold Pursuit.&nbsp;

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:28.380
There's a big problem in the church today.
A problem of lukewarm men who care more about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:32.640
living for the things of this world than&nbsp;
about living for the God of this world.&nbsp;

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.660
You cannot serve Christ with only&nbsp;
your heart or only your mind.&nbsp;

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.540
You need both.
In other words, you need to follow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:44.280
Christ with the right doctrine and devotion.
You need to follow Christ the way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:48.960
He wants you to follow Him.
Not following Him from the self-life.&nbsp;

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:55.200
You need to deny yourself, pick up your cross&nbsp;
and follow Jesus, if you truly love Him.&nbsp;

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.600
I'll see you in the next video.
Bye.

